OL,3,GNEWSACannabis farm discovered in
OL,4,Apopular match day pub
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former popular match day pub has been
OL,7,Fshut down following the discovery of a
OL,8,Fcannabis farm.
OL,10,FNorthumbria Police executed a warrant
OL,11,Fat The Wheatsheaf pub near the Stadium
OL,12,Fof Light in Sunderland at around 09:00
OL,13,Fon Sunday 18.
OL,15,FThe site was sealed off, along with the
OL,16,Fadjacent former Terminus pub.
OL,18,FA 53-year-old man was arrested on
OL,19,Fsuspicion of the production of
OL,20,Fcannabis, and has been released on bail
OL,21,Fpending further enquiries.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
